WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:01.968
-Paul.

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.234
-Thank you.
Good to see you, Jimmy.

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:05.801
-It is great to see you.

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:07.767
Dude, you look great, as always.
Look at you on the cover

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:09.000
of Men's Health magazine...
-Oh.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.067
[ Cheering and applause ]
...looking like a stud.

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:11.267
[ The Roots playing
"Celebration" ]

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:12.767
-No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:14.000
We can't --

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.501
-Whoo! Whoo!
-Thank you!

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:17.734
You know, now,
you're embarrassing me.

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.467
-No.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:21.734
-Bringing out Men's Health
already, out of the gate.

00:00:21.734 --> 00:00:24.300
[ Laughter ]
-No, I did it on your intro.
-Very sweet of you.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.734
-You're a stud.
This is awesome.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.234
You know, it's funny, because
your costar Jonathan Majors

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:30.367
