00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:50.501
[ Laughter ]
And I was like,

00:02:50.501 --> 00:02:52.434
"What am I, a wimp?
No! I want a --"

00:02:52.434 --> 00:02:54.834
-This one, though,
this one really made me laugh.

00:02:54.834 --> 00:02:56.834
This one made me laugh
because this is the best.

00:02:56.834 --> 00:02:59.634
This is him like working out.

00:02:59.634 --> 00:03:00.767
-Yeah.
-I've never seen --

00:03:00.767 --> 00:03:02.434
I've never seen this
in my lifetime.

00:03:02.434 --> 00:03:03.767
-Yeah.
-Here he is.

00:03:03.767 --> 00:03:07.033
