00:03:08.934 --> 00:03:10.133
-It's health and fitness.

00:03:10.133 --> 00:03:11.734
They want to see you,
you know, working out.

00:03:11.734 --> 00:03:15.000
-Yeah. And then here's
your workout photo.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.000
-Yeah.
-You're holding
