the bike.

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:32.167
[ Laughter ]
-No, no. I mean, you know,
it's health --

00:03:32.167 --> 00:03:33.501
it's, you know,
health and fitness.

00:03:33.501 --> 00:03:34.367
I got to --
-Yeah.

00:03:34.367 --> 00:03:35.567
